+| `FuzzObjectIdentityRepresentationInvariant`, fixed `100x`, `parallel=1` | 0 | 16 seed entries loaded |
+| `FuzzClosedIdentityShapeRefusal`, fixed `100x`, `parallel=1` | 0 | 49 seed entries loaded |
